{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222270","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322227001:1":{"text":"어제 <style=\"highlight\">얼음 호수</style> 근처에서 본 살아있는 시체는 다른 이들보다 훨씬 더 살아있는 사람처럼 행동하더군요. 의식이 남아있는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"昨天在<style=highlight>冰湖</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34DA3AB40C8D4172","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322227002:1":{"text":"그의 상태를 확인해 주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"我想拜托你去帮忙照看一下他的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89B819470C66A287","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322227003:1":{"text":"만약 정말 의식이 있다면 생전의 기억이 남았는지도 물어봐 주세요.","source_cn":"如果真的是这样的话，还请帮我问问看他是否还记得生前的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F2049019342C497","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}